k</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@NonNull</span> <wbr><a href=\"../DJICommonCallbacks/DJICommonCallbacks.html#djicommoncallbacks\"><span class=\"jv-prefix\">CommonCallbacks</span></a><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">.</span><a href=\"../DJICommonCallbacks/DJICommonCallbacks_CompletionCallback.html#djicommoncallbacks_completioncallback\"><span class=\"jv-type\">CompletionCallback</span></a> </code></span></td><td>注册结果回调（在主线程回调）。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"idisconnectactionmanager_clearpendingactions\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#idisconnectactionmanager_clearpendingactions_inline\">clearPendingActions</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"idisconnectactionmanager_clearpendingactions_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>clearPendingActions</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.20.1</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">clearPendingActions</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.open.pilot.client.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">清空本地待注册操作列表（不影响服务端已注册的记录）。如需同时清除服务端记录，请在调用此方法后再执行服务端清除操作。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n</font></div><font color